{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01174","headline":"相和歌辞 从军行 · 戎昱","name":"相和歌辞 从军行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔从李都尉，双鞬照马蹄。\n擒生黑山北，杀敌黄云西。\n太白沈虏地，边草复萋萋。\n归来邯郸市，百尺青楼梯。\n感激然诺重，平生胆力齐。\n芳筵暮歌发，艳粉轻鬟低。\n半醉秋风起，铁骑门前嘶。\n远戍报烽火，孤城严鼓鼙。\n挥鞭望尘去，少妇莫含啼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}